            "description": "Setpoints, objectives and additive deltas of the system operating mode control.\n\n- **SetpointActivePower**: Active power setpoint received from the supervisory control.\n- **SetpointActivePowerActual**: Actual active power setpoint published to the power control.\n- **ActivePowerObjective**: Active power objective (without override, transition, limits).\n- **AdditiveActivePowerDelta**: Total additive active power delta of the last calculation cycle.\n- **SetpointReactivePower**: Reactive power setpoint received from the supervisory control.\n- **SetpointReactivePowerActual**: Actual reactive power setpoint published to the power control.\n- **ReactivePowerObjective**: Reactive power objective (without override, transition, limits).\n- **AdditiveReactivePowerDelta**: Total additive reactive power delta of the last calculation cycle.",
